# Copy to .env (or .env.local) only if you need to override the backend URL.
#
# Without it, in development lib/api.ts uses the same machine as Metro on
# port 3000 (http://<your-LAN-IP>:3000), which works from a phone on the same
# Wi-Fi. Set it for a backend elsewhere (Railway/Render/Fly) or another port.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:3000
